OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of 'unprovoked' double
OL,4,Astabbing in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed two people in an
OL,7,F"unprovoked" attack in a village in
OL,8,FLeicestershire has been convicted
OL,9,Ffollowing a trial.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said Cohen
OL,12,FBarley, 24, stabbed two men through a
OL,13,Fwindow while they were sitting in a
OL,14,Fparked car in Station Road, Quorn, on
OL,15,F23 April.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
