OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of 'unprovoked' double
OL,4,Astabbing in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a trial at Leicester Crown
OL,7,FCourt, Barley was found guilty on
OL,8,FTuesday of causing grievous bodily harm
OL,9,Fwith intent, possession of a knife
OL,10,Fblade/sharp pointed article in a public
OL,11,Fplace and of wounding with intent. He
OL,12,Fwas found not guilty of attempted
OL,13,Fmurder.
OL,15,FBarley, of Hawthorn Road in
OL,16,FMountsorrel, is due to be sentenced on
OL,17,F17 December.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
